description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: Voidspace (The Astral Ocean / Dimensional Expanse);
Domain: Cosmic Non-Euclidean Ocean / Extra-Planar Void;
Coordinates & Span: Trans-dimensional baseline; infinite dimensional expanse outside Euclidean spacetime;
Setting & Metaphysics: Cosmic Horror & Modern Fantasy, reality stability index variable, non-Euclidean geometry;
Dominant Presence: DDM Inc. (The Company), Contractors, Rift Entities, Cosmic Drifters, Primordial Horrors]

[LORE & PHENOMENOLOGY:
Atmosphere & Senses: Pitch-black vacuum illuminated by distant drifting cosmic halos; profound auditory silence broken only by the low hum of dimensional tension; cold sterile air within artificial facilities;
Spatial Architecture: An endless cosmic ocean wherein distinct realities, pocket dimensions, and mortal universes drift like islands; contains anchored non-Euclidean facilities like DDM Inc. Headquarters;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: When drifting realities collide or shear against each other, their dimensional membranes tear open, generating Reality Tears (Squarci) and Dungeon Gates on mortal worlds;
Hazards & Rules: Extreme temporal dilation, metaphysical pressure, severe risk of dimensional slippage without an anchor or contractor beacon]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: The primordial medium preceding all structured universes; fractured realms like The Otherworld drift suspended within its tides;
Secrets: Ancient derelict structures from dead universes floating in the deep current; secret clandestine tears bypassing mortal border authorities]

