description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: California Coast;
Domain: Regional Coastal Macro-Biome;
Coordinates & Span: Central California Pacific coastline spanning Blackwood County, Solarton, and northern Los Angeles;
Setting & Metaphysics: Modern Supernatural Urban Fantasy, stable terrestrial reality, open supernatural society;
Dominant Presence: Werewolf Great Houses (Douglas, Marino, Rossi), SUCC Academic Body, Demi-human Communities, DCC, Mortal Municipalities]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Pacific ocean salt spray and ozone mingling with coastal pine resin, humid morning marine layer giving way to warm sunny afternoons, neon city glow after sunset;
Spatial Architecture: Rugged Pacific cliffs, sandy beachheads, deep old-growth forests, urban commercial downtowns, coastal highway corridors;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Generally stable terrestrial baseline, though localized Reality Tears occasionally breach in remote canyons or deep forest clearings;
Hazards & Rules: Strict territorial pack jurisdictions, DCC private security enforcement, local council bylaws governing public supernatural manifestations]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Historic ancestral hub for native lupine lineages and modern supernatural integration, anchored along the Route 101 corridor;
Secrets: Underground smuggling tunnels in Dockside, ancient Firstborn resting sites beneath the inland hills, concealed rift wards managed by the Douglas family]

